+// ABI 1.31 (extension_tab_helpers): tabs also carry Chromium's extension tab
+// helpers (TabHelper: ScriptExecutor, ExtensionActionRunner, activeTab
+// granter; SessionTabHelper without SessionService; WebNavigationTabObserver),
+// so content scripts, runtime messaging, webNavigation and tab-ID based APIs
